<title>USA: BTG files to offer 1.67 million shrs.</title>
<headline>BTG files to offer 1.67 million shrs.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said on Thursday that it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 1.67 million shares by the company and 80,000 shares by a selling shareholder.</p>
<p>The managing underwriters for the offering are Prudential Securities Inc, Janney Montgomery Scott Inc and Ferris, Baker Watts Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>BTG provides computer-related services and products to government and commercial clients.</p>
